{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）早上8時15分，屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開，有兩巴士相撞，釀成至少9人受傷，據報當中包括兩名巴士司機。救援人員接報趕抵到場為傷者治理，其中6人及後送往屯門醫院作進一步檢查。現場往屯門醫院方向交通受阻。</p><p>現場可見，兩部巴士頭撞尾，後方巴士為路線258D前往屯門寶田邨；巴士右邊車頭擋風玻璃撞至破裂，車頭燈損毀，碎片散落一地。九巴公司職員在場協助。</p><figure><img alt=\"屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開兩巴士相撞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189863795544166400512840.jpeg/DuHAxCaeAnhrHwlcgzvsvjac4B-jJr6PM37CdBl-wnQ\"/><figcaption>屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開兩巴士相撞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩部巴士頭撞尾，後方巴士右邊車頭擋風玻璃撞至破裂，車頭燈損毀。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189863791966294016679134.jpeg/bpKmS3mVQilHUT9VfsBDCSRAXk_LnprfU7OkGXmzpBk\"/><figcaption>兩部巴士頭撞尾，後方巴士右邊車頭擋風玻璃撞至破裂，車頭燈損毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救授人員接報趕抵。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189863798417395712319647.jpeg/pzDyNcek93wNhPtVaY4xcn4456ou6a0NqR_VNIMf1TQ\"/><figcaption>救授人員接報趕抵。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開有兩巴士相撞，往屯門醫院方向交通受阻。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189863967665688576051432.jpeg/6gz9sPFGoqEkl-3aeCfgSBIg9JFHJvqB9GEX9t5hF_Y\"/><figcaption>屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開有兩巴士相撞，往屯門醫院方向交通受阻。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩部巴士頭撞尾，後方巴士右邊車頭擋風玻璃撞至破裂，車頭燈損毀。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189864142211649536219853.jpeg/w5If2MqrWtzVLb3LgoA8nUui_Dbw2W5WudDXtZPQ17U\"/><figcaption>兩部巴士頭撞尾，後方巴士右邊車頭擋風玻璃撞至破裂，車頭燈損毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場往屯門醫院方向交通受阻。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189864137497251840684703.jpeg/ye8C7ZK6PcX_j6EuSVzgyDnXEL4UVj7D-n6eo9B-nqM\"/><figcaption>現場往屯門醫院方向交通受阻。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189864140324343808302685.jpeg/thOWHAGDX8WmRJQtFx5JUMTm9LPfwOyL4DN-ncozfp0\"/><figcaption>大批救援人員到場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受修。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189865567893327872458321.jpeg/voSDAL26sFutoE88UitejlKWCbvd3mY22vHMk_DxzJM\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受修。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩部巴士相撞，後方巴士右邊車頭受損。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189865570653310976975681.jpeg/y_nmKD8BKyVFBicD8Suush7W8VCiyPnTMHvCmRp7wpk\"/><figcaption>兩部巴士相撞，後方巴士右邊車頭受損。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"九巴職員在場協助。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189864153876533248782095.jpeg/HyxSTipxe2o-9ewyyDpN2-zkx5eTdDfUNLiVbB64lWw\"/><figcaption>九巴職員在場協助。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>意外釀成至少5男4女受傷，當中包括兩名巴士司機。傷者均受輕傷，經治理後6人送往屯門醫院作進一進檢查。</p><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189865801180647424948675.jpeg/xWq37J6RAVEAWq7Nuda167g5qQbG0lF1lqB_Lbygfy0\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189866289103900672463952.jpeg/LhP9vEhVkcawZk9dqCkj-_5c9kA8iy3mfhdPNlQXTzY\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189866291788386304839576.jpeg/0fyUhF534IaKVRxodpAzQ-JIx4TTecBIRN3AQW7dwEE\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189865803986767872746235.jpeg/T7pnf84fii20C23THUBsTx0gw8hahqF6KVUthgNVLYY\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189865798278057984519382.jpeg/MIWC81HIs4FLB_kCsGIVmHLrYOT_ixhlTqueumSrnro\"/><figcaption>意外釀成至少9人受傷，包括兩名巴士司機。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開，兩巴士發生碰撞，釀成至少8人受傷。（屯門公路塞車關注組/Suarez Cheung圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189859009834782720956147.jpeg/n6u_jC5ykvcgO7fgUDHqiaUyPBU_6Ce17h99Ju4ffSY\"/><figcaption>屯門鳴琴路近鳴琴輕鐵站對開，兩巴士發生碰撞，釀成至少8人受傷。（屯門公路塞車關注組/Suarez Cheung圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.433174+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":659,"images":16,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:55.742994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:55.742994+00:00","content_hash":"b0fdace665b2ad3d3772c74a2f9b5777db593d87f8330059a085d7f2e7cbd76e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}